{"4162110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VOSPETKA Simulator", "steam_appid": 4162110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE DORM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOSPETKA is a chaotic dorm supervisor simulator where you must control a crowd of restless students, maintain order, complete quests and management quotas, and sometimes... blow off steam.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/205e74c295a98a4128e607115b1425ec.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/205e74c295a98a4128e607115b1425ec.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/205e74c295a98a4128e607115b1425ec.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE TRUE HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dorm doesn’t like outsiders. Can you withstand the terror that the night has prepared for you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/37c3de4b20423c8db02c1e29a33e7d3a.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/37c3de4b20423c8db02c1e29a33e7d3a.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/37c3de4b20423c8db02c1e29a33e7d3a.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORDER REQUIRES A FIRM HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When persuasion fails, more... <i>educational methods</i> come into play. Enforce discipline, punish troublemakers, and let the whole building know: you're in charge.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/a2f96e3087d27bf98a2eb3970f1c0439.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/a2f96e3087d27bf98a2eb3970f1c0439.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/a2f96e3087d27bf98a2eb3970f1c0439.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR, CLEAN, SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dorm lives its own life — and most of the time, it’s against you. Students break furniture, dirty the walls, and create chaos. You’ll have to fix, clean, and patch everything to avoid getting in trouble with management.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/c93e92bc4bc4af2519c088cc6d7babb9.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/c93e92bc4bc4af2519c088cc6d7babb9.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/c93e92bc4bc4af2519c088cc6d7babb9.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR DORM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money for good management (or just for the building still standing) and improve the dorm: hire janitors, repair rooms, and expand the building to fit even more... chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/b1fee7f79a832e15962df28530afa551.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/b1fee7f79a832e15962df28530afa551.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/b1fee7f79a832e15962df28530afa551.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the dorm with friends! Share responsibilities, argue over students, and conduct joint floor inspections. Nothing brings people together like shared mess.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/384fe57d3e97e016092958f53406d2ae.poster.avif?t=1779474684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/384fe57d3e97e016092958f53406d2ae.webm?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162110/extras/384fe57d3e97e016092958f53406d2ae.mp4?t=1779474684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER: THE DORM IS NOT A PLACE — IT'S A DESTINY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every student is a potential disaster. But if you succeed, maybe at the end of your shift you’ll even be thanked. Or at least not beaten.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE DORM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOSPETKA is a chaotic dorm supervisor simulator where you must control a crowd of restless students, maintain order, complete quests and management quotas, and sometimes... blow off steam.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl